1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,510
My aunt's stall earned six dollars a day. Then I opened TikTok Shop.

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:09,431
First shipment: two hundred handmade bags. Sold out in nine minutes.

3
00:00:09,681 --> 00:00:12,145
The algorithm doesn't care where you were born.

4
00:00:12,395 --> 00:00:14,907
We went from one stall to forty artisans.

5
00:00:15,157 --> 00:00:19,997
Jakarta sunset. Three thousand orders. Zero sleep.

6
00:00:20,247 --> 00:00:23,288
Now we ship to Singapore, KL, and Manila.

7
00:00:23,538 --> 00:00:27,010
My aunt still packs every order. With a smile.

8
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:30,012
Follow us — Episode 2 shows the factory.
